# docker/e2e/.dockerignore
#
# Applied to every build context rooted at the repo. Keep secrets and
# heavy transient state out of ANY image layer.

**/.git
**/.venv
**/.venv_win
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Secrets — belt-and-suspenders. These are also excluded by .gitignore.
.env
**/.env
**/user_settings.json
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/credentials.json

# Harness output
docker/e2e/artifacts/
